From 4051ca7c82bdda26b05ddef9861eb53c8abb44de Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mabn <github@mabn.pl>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 13:42:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] Engine event log: Spring.GetUnitSampleData and the
 weapon reload log

GetUnitSampleData returns every unit's sampled state in one call (what the
per-unit Get* functions return under full read, in GetAllUnits' order).
SetEngineEventLog's third flag logs every write of a weapon's reloadStatus,
drained by Spring.GetLoggedReloads. Both full-read only; barreplay's widget
uses them in place of ~8 calls per unit per sample and a weapon-state call per
ready launcher slot per frame.
---
